{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064685/block/singleImage/3272293/df/1608970516_pu.JPG?updatedAt=1795083490\"/><figcaption>藍田啟田道中學「尿袋」冒煙起火，14歲男學生燒傷送院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (19 日 ) 下午 3 時許，警方及消防處接獲報案，指啟田道 5 號聖公會基孝中學發生火警。消防員趕抵現場前，火勢已被救熄，事件中毋須疏散。 據悉，事件疑涉及「尿袋」短路起火，當時正在使用「尿袋」充電的 14 歲男學生被燒傷，清醒由救護車送往聯合醫院治理，警方及消防正調查起火原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:36:31.140627+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:18:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T17:34:50.037533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:29:46.443606+00:00","content_hash":"8f794ea6834d9a181293af4e2648ab102b3cba18cf02e86e20d96aeb5cb687a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}